.TH HAMURABI 6 "Riplix" "Ripple"
.SH NAME
hamurabi \- govern ancient Sumeria for ten years
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamurabi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Buy and sell land, feed your people and plant crops. Twenty bushels feed
one person for a year. Each person can tend ten acres. Trade prices,
harvests, rats and plagues affect your city. Severe starvation leads to
impeachment. Survive a ten-year term and receive an assessment.
.PP
Enter a nonnegative whole number at each prompt. If you buy no land, you
may sell land instead. Zero is a valid answer. Enter q, a negative number,
or Ctrl-C to leave. End-of-input also exits cleanly.
.PP
Hamurabi is a text game; no graphics or special terminal is required.
